rooms_desc ({"You have arrived in a gargautian cavern. Its height exceeds 3000 feet!Most odd, you see two giant legs in the cavern... then a metal trunk...then two arms with a lasergun in them... then the head: the head ofHECTOR, the largest battlemech and spaceship in the world!He stands still in there in the dim light: his armour shines iwith a blueishcolour in the dim light. You see many missile slots all over him.You have a strange feeling... you feel that he is watching YOU, and smiles!You see a double-door in the right leg to the north.","You stand in the huge lift of Hector. It is large enough to carrya B-2 bomber easily. It is from the same metal alloy that the whole mechwere made of. It seems to be so quick as well. You see no buttons,but a bone-skull, Eddie: his eyes glow red, and if you push one of histeeth, it flashes in a green light. He surprisingly asks you:Where do you wish to go?You see the automat-double-doors of hector to the south, and you can go up.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"You have reached HECTOR...","The elevator of Hector",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
furnishings ({0,"",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
items ({({"hector","He is the largest battlemech in the world. His armour shines bright blue.",}),({"doors","Huge metal doors closing from up and down. They close hermetically...","door","Huge metal doors closing from up and down. They close hermetically...","eddie","A funny human skull. He maybe familiar for you from the ghostbusters...","Eddie","A funny human skull. He maybe familiar for you from the ghostbusters...","lift","A huge platform of metal. It moves quickly, if you choose to go.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
